// were reviewed against these exact numbers (cert-manager: 99 Deployments,
// 70 of them Stale), so the specs check the model against the same data.
//
// Shape: the root Base `base` -> one class Base per environment (dev, test,
// uat, prod) -> the Deployments of that environment. Every id, slug and
// display name is the Space name, so a spec can name a node directly.
